      "abstract_snippet": "Large language models (LLMs) have revolutionized AI applications across diverse domains. However, their widespread deployment has introduced critical security vulnerabilities, particularly prompt injection attacks that manipu... | Find, read and cite all the research you need on Tech Science Press",
